# Public SSH keys allowed to sign a release tag.
# git verify-tag reads this file (gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile).
#
# One key per line, sshd allowed-signers format:
#   <email> namespaces="git" <key-type> <public-key>
#
# Chris adds his ed25519-sk public key here. A file with no key lines
# fails closed: every deploy job refuses the tag. Do not put a private
# key in this file.
